nding of the business were submitted. Kindly submit enhanced documentation as to how the business operations are being funded and maintained, and by whom, as well as any documents evidencing the funds owned by the company through cashflow or other means. Kindly note that documents must be duly certified.","notes":"Customer Reply: Certified FS submitted. 29 July 2025: Dear Team, Kindly revise the document provided by the company and update the status accordingly. RCL: FS 2023 submitted showing a cash balance and some operational activity. More recent FS also required. Suggest this CL is closed and reviewed under LC CGA: Thank you for your feedback. Could you please clarify what actions we should take if the information provided is deemed insufficient? If the Source of Funding is considered sufficient, please proceed to close the item and approve the company’s Source of Funding (switch the toggle to green). At this point, we are unable to determine what information may be missing or whether the company fully complies with the requirements. RCL: This item is being closed, subject to its review under the corresponding license condition as per RCL comment above"},{"title":"Company Details","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-04","description":"Company details, including name, address and license number are to be written at the bottom of the website.","notes":"29 July 2025: Dear Team, The applicant at the time informed to have updated their website. Could you please revise the website and let them know if any further information is required?"},{"title":"QPA/2024/00612 - Burak Mahir Cinkaratas - All documents","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-01-23","description":"Please upload a better scan of all documents that you uploaded. For SOW, you must upload a certified bank statement that matches what you stated.","notes":null}]}]}]}